# Random Choice Generator Demo in PaniniVM Script (.pvm)
# Rolls a die, choosing a face from one through six, with the Divādi root दिव् (दीव्य)

# Step 1: Roll the die over the range one through six
एक + ङसिँ षष् + ङि दिव् + श्यन् + लोट् + सिप् ।

# Step 2: Print the face rolled
मुद्र् + णिच् + लोट् + सिप् फल + अम् ।
